Package: com.m3ga.m3gasignalbars
Name: M3gaSignalBars
Version: 0.1.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Cosmetic full-strength cellular signal bars for classic iOS 6.
 Displays five full native signal bars when enabled and restores the real modem
 signal display when disabled. This does not improve reception or create service.
 Includes Enable Fake Cell Bars, About the Tweak, Instructions, Info About Me,
 and the creator's website link.
Maintainer: M3gaIOS6p0w3r
Author: M3gaIOS6p0w3r
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 6.0)
